# Requests to the demo, for the REST client of your editor (VS Code REST Client,
# JetBrains HTTP Client). The certificate is self-signed.

@oie = https://localhost:8444/api
@auth = Basic admin:demo-oie-password

### Deployed channels with their counters (what Flows Monitoring reads)
GET {{oie}}/channels/statuses
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Accept: application/json

### Channel groups
GET {{oie}}/channelgroups
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Accept: application/json

### A patient summary request to HIE · Regional exchange API: the summary comes back
POST http://localhost:8190/hie/
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requestId": "HIE-demo", "patientId": "P00042", "requester": "Regional HIE", "purpose": "TREATMENT" }

### An insurance claim: the insurer cannot be reached, the claim waits in the queue
POST http://localhost:8189/claims/
Content-Type: application/json

{ "claimId": "CLM-demo", "patientId": "P00042", "insurer": "MUTUELLE-NORD", "amount": 152.40, "currency": "EUR" }

### A message through the API: name the destinations, or it reaches none (OIE-11)
POST {{oie}}/channels/5a4aa0ff-b675-4e44-930a-2e23cffd6eb1/messages?destinationMetaDataId=1
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Content-Type: text/plain

MSH|^~\&|WARDS|NORTH-HOSPITAL|LIS|NORTH-HOSPITAL|20261111120000||ORM^O01^ORM_O01|ORD-demo|P|2.5.1
PID|1||P00042^^^NORTH-HOSPITAL^PI||Moreau^Louis^^^^^L||19900617|M
ORC|NW|LAB-demo
OBR|1|LAB-demo||K^Potassium^LOCAL
